sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as ML Client / SDK
    participant Gunicorn as Gunicorn/Uvicorn<br/>Port 5000
    participant KubeAuth as kubernetes-auth Plugin<br/>(mlflow-kubernetes-plugins)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>SA Token Validation
    participant RBAC as RBAC Module<br/>mlflow/server/auth
    participant Workspace as Workspace Store<br/>kubernetes://
    participant Tracking as Tracking API<br/>Experiment Handler
    participant Registry as Model Registry<br/>API Handler
    participant ArtifactProxy as Artifact Proxy
    participant SQL as SQL Backend<br/>(PostgreSQL/SQLite)
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>(boto3)

    Note over Client,S3: Experiment Tracking Flow

    Client->>Gunicorn: POST /ajax-api/3.0/mlflow/runs/create<br/>Authorization: Bearer <SA Token><br/>X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE: <namespace>
    Gunicorn->>KubeAuth: Forward request
    KubeAuth->>K8sAPI: Validate SA bearer token<br/>/var/run/secrets/.../token
    K8sAPI-->>KubeAuth: Token valid, identity confirmed

    KubeAuth->>Workspace: Resolve workspace<br/>from X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE header
    Workspace->>K8sAPI: Lookup namespace scope
    K8sAPI-->>Workspace: Namespace confirmed
    Workspace-->>KubeAuth: Workspace context set

    KubeAuth->>RBAC: Check permissions<br/>(role, resource, action)
    RBAC-->>KubeAuth: Authorized

    KubeAuth->>Tracking: Dispatch to handler
    Tracking->>SQL: INSERT experiment run<br/>SQLAlchemy / psycopg2
    SQL-->>Tracking: Run ID created
    Tracking-->>Gunicorn: 200 OK + Run metadata
    Gunicorn-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,S3: Artifact Upload Flow

    Client->>Gunicorn: PUT /ajax-api/3.0/mlflow/artifacts<br/>Authorization: Bearer <SA Token>
    Gunicorn->>KubeAuth: Forward request
    KubeAuth->>K8sAPI: Validate token
    K8sAPI-->>KubeAuth: Valid
    KubeAuth->>RBAC: Check artifact write permission
    RBAC-->>KubeAuth: Authorized
    KubeAuth->>ArtifactProxy: Forward artifact data
    ArtifactProxy->>S3: PUT object<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>ArtifactProxy: Upload confirmed
    ArtifactProxy->>SQL: Update artifact metadata
    SQL-->>ArtifactProxy: Metadata stored
    ArtifactProxy-->>Gunicorn: 200 OK
    Gunicorn-->>Client: Upload successful

    Note over Client,S3: Model Registry Flow

    Client->>Gunicorn: POST /{name}/versions<br/>Authorization: Bearer <SA Token>
    Gunicorn->>KubeAuth: Forward request
    KubeAuth->>K8sAPI: Validate token
    K8sAPI-->>KubeAuth: Valid
    KubeAuth->>RBAC: Check model write permission
    RBAC-->>KubeAuth: Authorized
    KubeAuth->>Registry: Create model version
    Registry->>SQL: INSERT model version
    SQL-->>Registry: Version created
    Registry-->>Gunicorn: 200 OK + Version metadata
    Gunicorn-->>Client: JSON Response
